{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a mech. You collect iron. But you're building something different.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat Escalates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b30b9e49c4ddc9d0273f2ff9be608877.poster.avif?t=1766130309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b30b9e49c4ddc9d0273f2ff9be608877.webm?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b30b9e49c4ddc9d0273f2ff9be608877.mp4?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your first strike connects. Clean impact. You strike again. Effects start growing. Screen shake intensifies. Sounds boom. Visual impacts amplify with each successful hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You keep attacking. The feedback keeps climbing. Effects layer. Shake gets stronger. Sounds get heavier. What started simple becomes extreme. By the end you can barely track what's happening.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you're building power. Your enemy's building power. Both climbing. You need to overwhelm them before you overheat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You Weld Yourself Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/17642b1e92c0bc59b39775ea56c9443d.poster.avif?t=1766130309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/17642b1e92c0bc59b39775ea56c9443d.webm?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/17642b1e92c0bc59b39775ea56c9443d.mp4?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between fights, you explore rusted landscapes. Collect parts from failed mechs. Install launchers. Heavy strikes. Range attacks. Defensive tech. Whatever you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you build your moveset. Launch enemies into air combos? Chain rapid strikes? Counter with precision? Crush with heavy attacks? You choose every move. You wire it together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Same parts available to everyone. Completely different results based on what you build.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Build Will Fail</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b28e27ee7f56d802f5d3e2dd2e5d389a.poster.avif?t=1766130309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b28e27ee7f56d802f5d3e2dd2e5d389a.webm?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/b28e27ee7f56d802f5d3e2dd2e5d389a.mp4?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enemy will break your carefully constructed system. Your timings won't work. Your approach won't penetrate their defense. You'll overheat before they do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go back. Swap parts. Change moves. Different approach. The game won't tell you the answer. You figure it out or you lose. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break The Cycle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/c0d3d86bdae7033a2cf567f5cdabd54e.poster.avif?t=1766130309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/c0d3d86bdae7033a2cf567f5cdabd54e.webm?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/c0d3d86bdae7033a2cf567f5cdabd54e.mp4?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron's running out. Every mech operates alone. They mine mining scraps. They hoard resources. They fight anyone who gets close. This is the cycle. Endless extraction until there's nothing left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're Ironweld. You choose to break it. Build cooperation where there's only isolation. Unite mechs instead of fighting alone. Prove a better system works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will join you. Some will fight you. Both require proving your approach works through combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/2829637a642a973c67210d1db7c92dc2.poster.avif?t=1766130309\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/2829637a642a973c67210d1db7c92dc2.webm?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/extras/2829637a642a973c67210d1db7c92dc2.mp4?t=1766130309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400110?t=1766130309","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400110?t=1766130309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400110/e5e58a392d5